sequenceDiagram
    participant PO as Platform Operator
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant RMO as ray-module-operator<br/>controller-manager
    participant FS as Filesystem<br/>/opt/manifests/kuberay
    participant KR as KubeRay Operator<br/>(Operand)

    Note over PO,KR: Flow 1: Ray Module Reconciliation

    PO->>K8s: Create Ray CR<br/>(applicationsNamespace set)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    K8s-->>RMO: Watch event: Ray CR created
    RMO->>K8s: Read odh-ray-config ConfigMap<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    K8s-->>RMO: Distribution name, version
    RMO->>RMO: Check managementState<br/>(Managed vs Removed)
    RMO->>K8s: Check cert-manager CRDs exist<br/>(Issuer, Certificate)
    K8s-->>RMO: CRD discovery result
    RMO->>K8s: Check SCC API availability<br/>(one-time, cached)
    K8s-->>RMO: REST mapper result
    RMO->>FS: Read vendored KubeRay manifests<br/>/opt/manifests/kuberay/openshift
    FS-->>RMO: Kustomize manifests
    RMO->>RMO: Render kustomize manifests<br/>Inject RELATED_IMAGE_* params
    RMO->>K8s: SSA-apply rendered manifests<br/>(Deployment, RBAC, CRDs,<br/>webhooks, SCC)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    RMO->>K8s: Create ray ClusterRole<br/>(Notebook RBAC)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    RMO->>K8s: Update Ray CR status<br/>(health, distribution, release)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    K8s-->>KR: KubeRay Deployment created

    Note over PO,KR: Flow 2: Module Removal

    PO->>K8s: Set Ray CR<br/>spec.managementState: Removed<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    K8s-->>RMO: Watch event: Ray CR updated
    RMO->>RMO: Detect Removed state<br/>Skip manifest rendering
    RMO->>K8s: Delete owned operands<br/>(Deployments, ConfigMaps,<br/>Services, SAs, webhooks,<br/>ClusterRoles)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    RMO->>K8s: Delete ray ClusterRole<br/>(CRDs intentionally preserved)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    RMO->>K8s: Update Ray CR status<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
